  <questiondescription format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p id="concept">Sets: constructing a set for a given difference</p><p id="description">Grade 12 CBE Core and Essential 1.1 (c): Construct a set B, not inside A, so that the difference A - B is a given set.</p><p id="edition">Core and Essential</p><p id="provenance">This question is original to this project.</p><p id="citation">INNODEMS CBC Grade 12 Mathematics, first draft by Ben Davies, 2026. Aligned to the KICD Senior School Curriculum Design, Core and Essential Mathematics Grade 12 (draft).</p>]]></text></questiondescription>
